  "transformations": [
    "Integrated SoA layout from B with restrict qualifiers and tiled force computation from A, including unrolled inner j-loop by 4 and omp simd on the per-body accumulation loop.",
    "Hoisted per-tile position loads into local arrays (xis/yis/zis) to reduce memory traffic, as suggested by B's hoisting idea.",
    "Inlined body_force into main with a single #pragma omp parallel region per iteration and used dynamic schedule(16) for the force tile loop and static schedule for the position update, following C's scheduling strategy."
